# HexaBill UI Skill v2.0
**ERP-grade design system for Gulf VAT business operators**

---

## Design Philosophy
HexaBill must feel like: **modern Tally + mobile owner dashboard**  
NOT: startup SaaS, Material Design, Bootstrap, animation-heavy apps  
Target users: non-technical Gulf business owners + office staff on phones and tablets

---

## Color System (LOCKED)

```css
/* Brand — use for CTAs only */
primary-600: #2563EB
primary-700: #1D4ED8  /* hover */
primary-50:  #EFF6FF  /* active backgrounds */

/* Surfaces */
