---

## Typography Scale

Font family: **Inter** (already in tailwind config)

```
11px font-medium  → Badge text, table labels, chip labels
13px font-normal  → Table rows, secondary form text
14px font-normal  → Default body, form inputs, dropdown items
15px font-medium  → Form labels, card titles
18px font-semibold → Section headers, tab labels
22px font-bold    → Page titles
28px font-bold + tracking-tight → KPI dashboard numbers
```

Dashboard KPI numbers:
```jsx
<p className="text-[28px] font-bold tracking-tight leading-none">
  {formatCurrency(value)}
</p>
```

---

## Spacing — 8pt Grid Only

```
4px  → inline icon gap, badge padding x
8px  → gap-2, compact groupings
12px → input internal padding
16px → p-4, gap-4 (mobile default, card padding mobile)
24px → p-6, gap-6 (desktop card padding, section gap mobile)
32px → gap-8 (major section gaps)
48px → gap-12 (page top padding desktop)
```

