## State Pattern — Required for Every Async Component

```jsx
const MyPage = () => {
  const [data, setData] = useState([])
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true)
  const [error, setError] = useState(null)

  useEffect(() => {
    const fetch = async () => {
      try {
        setLoading(true)
        setError(null)
        const result = await someAPI.getAll()
        setData(result)
      } catch (err) {
        setError(err.message || 'Failed to load')
      } finally {
        setLoading(false)
      }
    }
    fetch()
  }, [])

  if (loading) return <LoadingSkeleton rows={5} />
  if (error) return <ErrorState message={error} onRetry={() => fetch()} />
  if (!data.length) return <EmptyState title="No records yet" subtitle="Create your first record" />
  return <DataView data={data} />
}
```

---

## Micro-Interactions (Minimal)

Only these. Nothing else:
- Button click: `active:scale-[0.97] transition-transform duration-75`
- Save success: `<SuccessFeedback />` component — slide up toast, 2s auto-dismiss
- Form error: shake animation on submit `animate-shake`
- Page transitions: none (instant is faster, feels operational)
- List item add: no animation (just re-render)

---

## Accessibility

- All inputs: `aria-label` or `<label htmlFor>`
- Icon-only buttons: `aria-label="..."`
- Color not sole indicator: status badges have text + color
- Focus visible: `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500/20 focus:border-primary-500`
- Min contrast: text-neutral-500 on white = 4.6:1 (passes AA)

---

## What NOT to Do

- No `shadow-xl` or larger on cards
- No gradients (no `bg-gradient-*`)
- No emoji as icons
- No inline `style={{}}` except computed values
- No `p-1`, `p-2`, `p-3`, `p-5`, `p-7` — use 8pt grid only
- No animations on data tables or form fields
- No `text-xs` below 11px on any mobile element
- No `overflow-x-scroll` on page level (fix the layout instead)
- No mixing oklch and hex in same token system
